{
    "flags": 62,
    "pad": "8686",
    "messages": [
        {
            "id": "a003_159_0000",
            "en_US": [
                "I may walk fast, but I live a slow and\n",
                "relaxing life."
            ],
            "flags": 224
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_159_0001",
            "en_US": [
                "I'm going home early today to have\n",
                "Pokémon battles with my sisters."
            ],
            "flags": 224
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_159_0002",
            "en_US": [
                "Hello!\n",
                "Greeting is important, isn't it?"
            ],
            "flags": 224
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_159_0003",
            "en_US": [
                "They say time is money. But when you\n",
                "spend time, you can't get it back."
            ],
            "flags": 224
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_159_0004",
            "en_US": "There are always so many people here...",
            "flags": 224
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_159_0005",
            "en_US": [
                "Even when I loaf, I do it all-out.\n",
                "I am always serious!"
            ],
            "flags": 224
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_159_0006",
            "en_US": [
                "This city is a sleepless city...\n",
                "But I need my beauty sleep."
            ],
            "flags": 224
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_159_0007",
            "en_US": [
                "I wish there were shoes\n",
                "that recharge energy by walking!"
            ],
            "flags": 224
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_159_0008",
            "en_US": "My big customer must be waiting...",
            "flags": 224
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_159_0009",
            "en_US": [
                "I just keep walking...today, tomorrow,\n",
                "and the day after tomorrow."
            ],
            "flags": 224
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_159_0010",
            "en_US": [
                "Good luck! Me!\n",
                "Good luck! You!"
            ],
            "flags": 224
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_159_0011",
            "en_US": [
                "I will watch a baseball game\n",
                "this weekend."
            ],
            "flags": 224
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_159_0012",
            "en_US": [
                "I am having a battle called a job!\n",
                "This is quite tough. That's why it's fun!"
            ],
            "flags": 224
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_159_0013",
            "en_US": [
                "Hmmm... It may be a good idea\n",
                "to Dress Up your Pokémon."
            ],
            "flags": 224
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_159_0014",
            "en_US": [
                "Have you had a Pokémon battle\n",
                "with the Gym Leader, Burgh?{VAR BE01}\n",
                "He's a strange one, but he likes Pokémon\n",
                "very much."
            ],
            "flags": 224
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_159_0015",
            "en_US": [
                "I haven't traveled with my Pokémon\n",
                "for a long time. I feel like doing that..."
            ],
            "flags": 224
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_159_0016",
            "en_US": [
                "I will go to the Kanto region\n",
                "for business."
            ],
            "flags": 224
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_159_0017",
            "en_US": [
                "People from different countries\n",
                "gather here in Castelia City."
            ],
            "flags": 224
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_159_0018",
            "en_US": "Everyone is a professional walker!",
            "flags": 224
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_159_0019",
            "en_US": [
                "Even in the crowd of people,\n",
                "don't lose sight of yourself!"
            ],
            "flags": 224
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_159_0020",
            "en_US": "Every day, everybody goes their own way.",
            "flags": 224
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_159_0021",
            "en_US": [
                "My business card has a picture of\n",
                "the Pokémon I like best."
            ],
            "flags": 224
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_159_0022",
            "en_US": [
                "I always walk here, so\n",
                "I am good at dodging people."
            ],
            "flags": 224
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_159_0023",
            "en_US": [
                "Argh! You distracted me! I was trying\n",
                "to count all the pedestrians!"
            ],
            "flags": 224
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_159_0024",
            "en_US": [
                "Hey, hey, kid!\n",
                "It's dangerous!"
            ],
            "flags": 224
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_159_0025",
            "en_US": [
                "Will you become a motorbike rider\n",
                "when you grow up?"
            ],
            "flags": 224
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_159_0026",
            "en_US": [
                "The night wind is piercing right through\n",
                "me... My motorbike is freezing, too..."
            ],
            "flags": 224
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_159_0027",
            "en_US": "Zowieee!",
            "flags": 224
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_159_0028",
            "en_US": "Wooooo!"
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_159_0029",
            "en_US": "Is that so?"
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_159_0030",
            "en_US": "Yes."
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_159_0031",
            "en_US": "Huh?"
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_159_0032",
            "en_US": "Oh, no!"
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_159_0033",
            "en_US": "What's up?"
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_159_0034",
            "en_US": "Sorry."
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_159_0035",
            "en_US": "Bye-bye!"
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_159_0036",
            "en_US": "Nah."
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_159_0037",
            "en_US": "Eep!"
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_159_0038",
            "en_US": "I see!"
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_159_0039",
            "en_US": "How is it?"
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_159_0040",
            "en_US": "Hello!"
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_159_0041",
            "en_US": "...?"
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_159_0042",
            "en_US": "Ouch..."
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_159_0043",
            "en_US": "Hi!"
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_159_0044",
            "en_US": "!!"
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_159_0045",
            "en_US": "Hungry..."
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_159_0046",
            "en_US": "One, two..."
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_159_0047",
            "en_US": "What?"
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_159_0048",
            "en_US": "10Q!"
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_159_0049",
            "en_US": "Zooom!"
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_159_0050",
            "en_US": "Yahooo!"
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_159_0051",
            "en_US": "Bleah."
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_159_0052",
            "en_US": "Move it!"
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_159_0053",
            "en_US": "Yuck!"
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_159_0054",
            "en_US": "Wait!"
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_159_0055",
            "en_US": "Fffweee!"
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_159_0056",
            "en_US": "Faster!"
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_159_0057",
            "en_US": "Wahaha!"
        }
    ]
}
